  "body": "All agents buyers welcome, contact George for Conjunctional.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented and solidly constructed, this charming single-level brick and tile freehold home delivers effortless family living in one of Bucklands Beach's most tightly held and desirable neighbourhoods. Set within an exceptional school catchment, zoned for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and the highly sought-after Macleans College, this address represents a true investment in your family's future.\r\n\r\nStep inside and feel instantly at home. Three generous bedrooms and two well-appointed bathrooms provide comfortable accommodation for families of all ages, while the light-filled open-plan living and dining areas create a welcoming hub for everyday life. Designed for seamless indoor-outdoor flow, the living space opens onto a sun-drenched deck and a fully fenced, easy-care garden-ideal for relaxed entertaining, summer BBQs, and a safe haven for children and pets to play.\r\n\r\nPracticality meets convenience with double internal-access garaging, complemented by additional off-street parking and space for a boat-perfect for those who embrace the coastal lifestyle. Whether you're hosting friends, raising a family, or simply enjoying peaceful living, this home offers comfort, functionality, and flexibility in equal measure.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of Bucklands Beach living with Eastern Beach, Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry services, local cafes, and restaurants all just a short stroll away. From morning beach walks to weekend brunches and effortless commuting, this location truly has it all.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are rare-homes of this quality, in such a prized location, are always in demand. Act quickly and contact Team Tina today to secure this exceptional home and start living the lifestyle you deserve.",
